                                "sense_id": "57541bc6-6f18-3da2-805f-7b4701745155",
                                "text": "Harare, the capital, was abuzz on Tuesday with such so-called insider accounts, each one undoubtedly taking new plot twists as they went from secondhand to thirdhand and further on."
